	/**
	 * A bank belongs to an ACCOUNT. 0 is this plugin's "nobody is logged in" and -1 is the client's own "has
	 * not logged in yet" ({@code com/jagex/oldscape/pub/OAuthApi.java:30-32}), so a snapshot carrying either
